<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Forever Mitu ❤️ Sabbir</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div id="stars"></div>

<section class="welcome">

    <h3>✨ A Special Surprise ✨</h3>

    <h1>Mitu ❤️ Sabbir</h1>

    <p>Every love story is beautiful...</p>

    <button id="openBtn">
        Tap To Open ❤️
    </button>

</section>


<section id="giftSection">

<div class="gift-box">
🎁
</div>

<h2>Open Your Gift</h2>

</section>



<section id="gallery">

<h2>Our Beautiful Memories ❤️</h2>


</section>



<section id="letter">

<h1>💌</h1>

<h2>Dear Mitu,</h2>

<p>

Every day with you is

my favourite day.

You are my happiness,

my peace,

my everything.

Thank you for coming

into my life.

I don't promise

a perfect life...

But

I promise

I'll always love you.

Forever Yours,

❤️ Sabbir ❤️

</p>

</section>




<section id="counter">

<h2>Together Since</h2>

<h1>11 June 2025 ❤️</h1>

<p id="days"></p>

</section>




<section id="final">

<h1>

I LOVE YOU

MITU ❤️

</h1>

<h3>

Forever Starts Here...

</h3>

